# The Abyss Expedition - a world plan of the library: an expedition downwards
# A free-form adventure beside Raft's story: each island leads deeper - an old mine, a buried shelter, a sunken island,
# the caverns under a mountain, a wreck, a drowned city - and at the end the Abyss, a trench where something old lives
# in the dark. Each island comes when the quest of the one before is done, near it (the generated ones - a sunken
# island and a wreck - are new in every world).
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe plan_abyss) in the editor's World plans window. Its play test:
# content\tests\plan_abyss.play.
plan new The Abyss Expedition
plan description An expedition downwards beside Raft's story: an old mine, a buried shelter, a sunken island, caverns, a wreck and a drowned city - each found when the one before is done - and at the end the Abyss, a trench where something old lives in the dark. Its main islands are about 90% the size of Raft's own big islands.
plan random off
plan story on
plan rule mine | island:Old Mine Islet | start | receiver:500 | A mining company's old beacon still answers on the Receiver: the timbered portal in its rock mound is where the expedition starts. | Old Mine Islet | beside
plan rule shelter | island:Shelter Atoll | quest:mine | receiver:700 | The receiver picks up a shelter's call sign - an atoll, its emergency band still open. | Shelter Atoll | beside
plan rule sunken | type:sunken | quest:shelter | receiver:600 | The shelter's radio picks up a buoy over an island under the sea. Dive! | Sunken island | beside
plan rule caverns | island:Ironreef Caverns | visit:sunken | receiver:800 | From the sunken island's peak the Receiver catches a mine's relay: a mountain full of caves. | Ironreef Caverns | beside
plan rule wreck | type:wreck | quest:caverns | receiver:600 | A ship's distress beacon, faint and looping: a wreck adrift beyond the caverns. | Wreck | beside
plan rule city | island:The Drowned Metropolis | visit:wreck | receiver:800 | The wreck's log gives Meridian's harbour band: "Don't go down to the foundations." | Drowned Metropolis | beside
plan rule abyss | island:The Abyss | quest:city | receiver:900 | The Lantern Lord's lair hums with a signal from below: a trench - the Abyss. | The Abyss | beside
plan ending Down in the trench the lights go out one by one, and the thing in the dark sleeps again. The Abyss is charted; the expedition is over.\n\nThe end of The Abyss Expedition.
plan save
